    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "breaks dont do anything. i take a shower or a nap or i sit in the car for ten minutes, and then i'm right back in it. it's not even about being tired, it's like... i'm just trapped in this loop. it feels permanent. like there's no version of the future where i'm not just a ghost serving everyone else. i just want it to stop. all of it.",
