      "content": "yeah, i feel like i have zero control. every single choice i make is basically just for them. even my own thoughts feel like they belong to someone else. i just want to find some peace... something that actually makes the noise stop and lets me just be nothing for a while. is that even possible? to just... stop existing in this way?",
